elif Event.Day == 0:
	So this is what remains of the Guardian.
	It's quite dark, and I can't see it well.
	But... it feels like this thing is still somehow alive.
	do npc("P").look_to("R")
	I should probably go back, this place is incredibly dangerous.
=> END

