do npc("Maple").look_to(Direction.LEFT)
Maple.Neutral: Oh, sorry. I thought it was injured.
Mira.Upset: N-no no! It... was.
do npc("Mira").move_dir(Direction.RIGHT)
do npc("Mira").set_anim("EvCoverFace")
Mira: Thank you...
Mira: I'm sorry...
