do no_nametag()
Maple.Neutral: Infloris.
do npc("Mira").set_anim("EvCoverFace")
Mira.Upset: Oh, I...
do npc("Mira").look_to(Direction.RIGHT)
Mira.Neutral: I've read about your species!
do no_nametag()
Maple.Neutral: Same!
do no_nametag()
Maple.Neutral: I mean- Cyrenians![br]You look so cool!
do no_nametag()
Maple.Neutral: I've never actually talked to one up-close, excuse my excitement-
Mira.Smile: Hehe... We are a rarity these days, aren't we...
