do npc("Maple").go_to("MapleBench+(12, 0)")
do npc("Mira").set_anim("IdleUp")
Mira: Your name?
Maple.Neutral: Maple.
Mira: It's a nice name...[br]I'm Mira by the way.
[hide]
Mira.Curious: Hey, What was the thing you poured on my arm earlier?
Maple.Neutral: Oh it's a homebrewed potion. Alchemy fascinates me.
[hide]
do wait(0.5)
Mira: I'm sorry if I disturbed you earlier... I was just...
Maple.Neutral: Very distraught and emotionally conflicted so you had to run away to get some alone time?
Maple.Neutral: Umm, yeah.
Maple.Neutral: I could tell.
Maple.Neutral: I guess I should leave you alone now.
Mira: Wait-
Mira: Can you... stay a bit longer?
Maple: ...[br]Sure.
[hide]
do wait(2)
do transition(Direction.LEFT)
After spending some time looking out with Maple, I headed back to my new room.
